WEBVTT

00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:14,000
You think it's important to use organic alcohols when you make your own

00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:24,400
tinctures? We do. I do. It's just as easy to get it. You might as well. We use it organic vodka.

00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:28,160
I can't remember the name on it. Megan probably does.

00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:36,640
Yeah, so yeah, I think it's a good idea. Whatever you're

00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:42,880
using anything to use organic because alcohol is made from grains and I'm

00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:48,880
sure it's filled with all sorts of, you know, pesticides at herbicides if we

00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:55,040
really looked at it. So I would definitely use it organic.

